ADDITIONAL NOTICE — FINANCIAL SOFTWARE

This software places orders against a live cryptocurrency exchange and can
lose money. It is published as an engineering and research artifact, not as
investment advice and not as a product.

No strategy in this repository has passed its own validation gates. As of
2026-06-05, all eleven strategies analysed were rejected at TIER_D under a
Deflated Sharpe Ratio test, and two subsequent forward hypotheses were also
rejected. See docs/research/retrospective/PORTFOLIO_SUMMARY_2026-06-05.md.

The live trading path is disabled by default (LIVE_TRADING_ENABLED is off)
and the API has no authentication. Do not expose it to a network you do not
control. Anyone running this with real capital does so entirely at their own
risk.
